<title>FRANCE: Casino nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Casino nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					48,677    vs   46,666</p>
<p>    Third Quarter				 17,047    vs   16,584</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the results in the BALO official bulletin.</p>
